⚠️ **`public.profiles` went 7 → 1, and that is COMMITTED DATA LOSS on shared TEST.**
It is inherent to a restore — `public` is dropped and rebuilt, so the 7 rows CI had
accumulated are gone and only the migration-seeded row came back. It is exactly what
`T-164.8-09` describes and it is recorded here rather than buried under the six rows
that went up. TEST is shared, so some of those 7 rows may not have been ours.

